      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Plain markdown gets you headings, lists, and links. markoto extends that with the things people actually need to publish real documents: syntax-highlighted code, math, GitHub-style alert callouts, and eight kinds of Mermaid diagram. Everything renders in the live preview and survives PDF export.",
